WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:10.460 --> 00:00:16.580
mr. Butler how much importance do you place on&nbsp;
this speculation regarding President Eisenhower's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:16.580 --> 00:00:22.670
inability to run well I think Washington is sort&nbsp;
of the nerve center of American politics and any&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:22.670 --> 00:00:29.570
report or speculation that comes out of Washington&nbsp;
is worthy of some consideration if you think&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:29.570 --> 00:00:33.920
the president could stand up under a rigorous&nbsp;
campaign and another four years in the presidency&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:33.920 --> 00:00:40.580
well I don't know the fact that he said in Panama&nbsp;
recently that he didn't have much strength and he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:40.580 --> 00:00:47.750
was just trying to keep going on is an indication&nbsp;
to me that other people around him are attributing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:47.750 --> 00:00:53.780
more strength to it and greater physical capacity&nbsp;
than he himself is able honestly to admit

